:73984","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c63356","characterName":"クロード","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"53502","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213199"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16546"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63356"},"originalCharacterName":"クロード","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Freya's partner, Claude is a young man from Donai village who has received training to be the dragonmaster. But even though he has done his training, he has yet gained a partner - until the village chief permitted him to participate in a ritual to meet a dragon and he trekked into the depths of the forest to search for his own partner. He found her under a large tree: a cute dragon girl named Freya."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Freya is my partner. I'm sure of that.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63356"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。フレイアのパートナー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜使いとして一通り訓練を受けてきたドナイ村の青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜使いになることにあこがれ、厳しい修行を行ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大ざっぱでがさつなところもあるが、ドラゴンを思う気持ちは人一倍強い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16546","sourceWorkId":"25217","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6e30c8b06734300e53ef5ffd9314a8033ba1d84c3ae8f112269c9b8f64f35543.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/169d9a6d17ce75a84f85c3f81755a5432a4707853c6d6ddd8843e8f57581dc88.webp","width":202,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"髙橋孝治","creatorId":"vndb:s14404","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14404","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14404","name":"六条太助","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:213199:53502:13492:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c63357","characterName":"フレイア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"53501","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213199"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16545"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63357"},"originalCharacterName":"フレイア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"67"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"68"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Claude's partner. A young dragon that for some reason loses magic power even without fighting monsters, a thing that shouldn't happen. In Claude's village there's a lullaby that says dragons t like Freya should be linked as partners, but Claude ignores the Chief's warnings and becomes partner with Freya. Together they travel to find why Freya loses magic power and why the lullaby says they shouldn't bond."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She instantly gets fond of of people(except Willow) and loves cute things. She calls Claude \"Onii-chan\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Later on the story, depending how you educate her, she can have 4 possible personalities: Warm and Snug Freya, Intellectual Freya, Ojou-sama Type Freya or she can continue to be the same Freya with the same personality and the same Young Dragon undeveloped body."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63357"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クロードが「逢竜の儀」においてであったドラゴンの少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天真爛漫でクロードの事を「お兄ちゃん」と呼ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛い物が大好きで、「可愛いは正義!」が口癖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何もしていなくても自身の魔力が消費されてしまう「禍」を有しており、それでも契約してくれたクロードの事を信頼している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16545","sourceWorkId":"25217","spoile